<title>USA: U.S. bank borrowings avg $373 mln/day August 13 wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. bank borrowings avg $373 mln/day August 13 wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said U.S. bank discount window borrowings, less extended credits, averaged $373 million per day in the week ended August 13.</p>
<p>Extended credits were nil.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
</text>
